    "_postman_id": "c9e8f1b4-2b63-4c91-bf92-74718b528e10",
    "name": "Hospital Appointment Scheduling System (Patient Booking)",
    "description": "Complete Postman API Collection for the Hospital Appointment Scheduling System - Patient Booking Module.\n\n### How to Run\n1. Ensure the backend is running at `http://localhost:8080`.\n2. Click on the collection name and click **Run** (or run requests sequentially).\n3. The **Login (Demo Patient)** request automatically extracts the JWT token and saves it to the collection variable `{{token}}`.\n4. All authenticated endpoints inherit `{{token}}` automatically.\n5. Doctor dates and slots dynamically populate `{{slotDate}}`, `{{slotId}}`, `{{newSlotId}}`, and `{{appointmentId}}` for automated end-to-end testing.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "slotDate",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
